    "sentence_translations": [
      "And You Are …?",
      "",
      "“Hello!” The phone call came, and Mom was on the phone, “I’m Gao Xiaoyue, and you are…?”",
      "",
      "Was it not a phone call from Dad?",
      "",
      "“Hello! Your items have arrived. I’m in front of your house; please come down,” the person said.",
      "",
      "“Items? What items? I didn’t buy anything,” Mom said.",
      "",
      "“I don’t know,” the person said. “It says on the items … birthday gift.”",
      "",
      "“Birthday gift? Oh, right! It’s my birthday tomorrow.”",
      "Mom was looking at the computer and asked, “Who is this birthday gift from?”",
      "",
      "“Someone called Dabei,” the person said.",
      "",
      "“Dabei!” Mom yelled, “Please give me a few minutes; I’m coming.”",
      "",
      "What is a gift? I didn’t know. But I thought, a gift is a good thing, because Mom was very happy.",
      "",
      "Mom left.  After a few minutes, I heard Mom yell, “Ah …”",
      "",
      "What happened to Mom? I really wanted to go and see.",
      ""
